# Incremental Implementation

{%- include "templates/.harness/skills-shared/objective-control/CONTROL." ~ harness_language ~ ".md.jinja" %}

This is **the governing execution skill**. Consume the current item plan; restate its macro objective, graph edge, deliverable, and test IDs. Implement only enough to make that edge traversable. Run its `functional`, `quality`, and `regression` tests and verify the real output.

Every validated slice MUST immediately produce an atomic LOCAL commit containing only its files. Local commits need no extra authorization. Push to any remote and merge to remote `main` require explicit human authorization. Do not accumulate a whole phase before testing or mix unrelated refactors. Record each test ID on the exact command executed, and never let an uncommitted slice or simplification reach delivery.
